// The seed thrower's ammunition, and produce's reason to exist.
//
// Cheaper per shot than darts and slower to make, so a thrower is the
// answer to *many* things rather than to one hard thing — which is what
// keeps the second emplacement a different shape rather than an upgrade
// (`SYSTEMS.md` §5.3). Tone: these are seeds, thrown to make ground
// grow over and become hard to cross. Nothing here is ordnance.
#![enable(implicit_some)]
ItemDef(
    id: "item.seed_bombs",
    name: "Seed bombs",
    glyph: "🌰",
    order: 42,
)
